MORET_BEGIN
GODIVA GRAP apres MATE
* Hypothese : H10d GRAP non immediatement apres GEOM (ici apres MATE) rejete (skills v2)
* Attendu    : erreur d ordre de blocs

GEOM
  MODU 0
    TYPE 1 SPHE 8.7407
    VOLU 1 0 1 UMET 0. 0. 0.
  ENDM
ENDG

MATE
  CONT
    LIBR jeff311.xml
    TEMP 300
    COMP UMET
      CONC
        U234 4.91895E-04
        U235 4.49988E-02
        U238 2.49865E-03
    ENDC
  ENDM

GRAP Z 0.0
ENDG

SOUR
  UNIF 1000
ENDS

TERM
  CYCL PASS 30 ACTI 100
ENDT

ENDD
MORET_END
